    <kg:externalMatchCertainty>confirmed</kg:externalMatchCertainty>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">prominent Karaite banker of Fustat (active 1011-1035); still alive | the Fustat Karaite banker; ancestor name Abda in signature decoration | the Fustat Karaite banker; father Hayyim already dead here</rdfs:comment>
